    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Towing is a modern and responsive WordPress theme designed for towing companies, roadside assistance services, auto recovery businesses, vehicle transport providers, and car repair professionals. Built with performance and usability in mind, the theme features a professional layout, mobile-friendly design, customizable homepage sections, service showcase areas, call-to-action banners, appointment/contact forms, and SEO-optimized code. ST Towing supports Elementor, WooCommerce, and popular WordPress plugins, making it easy to create a powerful online presence for your towing or automotive business. Whether you offer emergency towing, flat tire assistance, jump starts, or vehicle recovery services, ST Towing helps you present your business with trust and professionalism."
    },
